WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:08.934
Click the Ultimate Joystick shortcut on the desktop.

2
00:00:08.955 --> 00:00:14.903
Ultimate Joystick opens to the Monitor & Test page.

3
00:00:14.911 --> 00:00:21.204
The top tabs organize the main areas of the program.

4
00:00:21.214 --> 00:00:27.072
Pause on the connection status before using the controls.

5
00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:32.472
Click No Hardware Mode when you are preparing without the controller attached.

6
00:00:32.481 --> 00:00:37.502
Click Refresh to update the controller connection area.

7
00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:43.472
Pause again and confirm the status line is ready.

8
00:00:43.481 --> 00:00:49.232
Pause on Servo Controls and confirm the default gate state.

9
00:00:49.241 --> 00:00:54.432
Copy Log saves the visible activity details for review.

10
00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:58.262
View Errors opens the error details when something fails.

11
00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:03.442
Settings is the shortcut to the configuration area.

12
00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:11.002
Start and connection review is complete.
